### The submitted Purchase Receipts that list an Item, newest first (0.1.124;
	# logicx-front's Vendor Stock Explorer, GRN tab). One row per voucher line of
	# the Item, at most 100; `more` says there were more.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v2/method/logicx_biz.logicx_erp.stock_view.get_item_vouchers
	?voucher_type=Purchase Receipt
	&item_code=P3170
Authorization: token {{token}}

